  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Coefficient of $x^n$ in $(1+x)(1-x)^n=(1+x)\\left({ }^n C_0-{ }^n C_1 x+\\ldots \\ldots .+(-1)^{n-1}{ }^n C_{n-1} x^{n-1}+(-1)^n\\right.$\n$\\left.{ }^n C_n x^n\\right)$\n$=(-1)^n{ }^n C_n+(-1)^{n-1}{ }^n C_{n-1}=(-1)^n(1-n)$",
    "image": null
  },
